          "analysisZh": "主干是动名词短语作主语的 Focusing on gratitude can bring you ... and help you ...：主语是“专注于感恩”，can 后面并列两个谓语 bring 和 help。bring you an increased sense of well-being 是“给你带来更强的幸福感”；help you transform A into B 是“帮你把 A 变成 B”，A 是 your understanding of belongings and abilities（你对所拥有的东西和能力的认识），B 是 sources of gratitude（感恩的来源）。这句正是第 39 题答案里 mental health benefits 的具体内容。",
